      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Dragon Necropolis [CoV]\n**Who:**\n- Tilly Rocksmelt - CoV [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 113\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n**Quest Items:**\n- Necropolis Venom [item=140263]\n- Vial of Necropolis Poison [item=140264]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Dragon Necropolis (10 Points) [quest=10281]\n**Era:** | !Claws of Veeshan\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Oct 29 11:41:14 2020\nModified: Mon Jul 29 07:13:46 2024 | | **Claws of Veeshan Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**Prerequisite Quests:** None.\nYou can obtain this quest from Tilly Rocksmelt in Dragon Necropolis. She is located at /loc 1016, 718, -34 and is on the find tool CTRL F.\nYou say, 'Hail, Tilly Rocksmelt'\nTilly Rocksmelt addresses you cheerfully, as another person out working on a job to another, 'Oi! I see you ended up in this horrid place as well.' Tilly Rocksmelt points her thumb at the tunnel behind her, 'You see that tunnel? If you thought the ratmen here were a pain to deal with imagine them cold, undead, and very [upset] about it.'\nYou say, ' If they are undead, how can they be upset?'\nTilly Rocksmelt shrugs with a confused look, 'I'm not being paid to understand the finer purviews of philosophy of the paebala society, so I don't care.' Tilly Rocksmelt looks down the tunnel before continuing to speak, 'Before many of them turned, it seems that the paebala were building a blockade in this tunnel, mind checking it out for me? These tunnels are a terrifying ordeal that I do not think I'm fully equipped enough to handle on my own. It's clear that they got interrupted in their work, but I need a set of eyes check out how well it's [built].'\nYou say, 'built'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Let Them Stew'.\n\n---\n\n**Task Window Text:** Tilly Rocksmelt is concerned about the number of ratmen who have been living in the tunnels under the Dragon Necropolis. She has a plan but is in need of a hero to help her get what she needs.\n1\\. Check the barricade within the tunnel behind Tilly 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n> **Task Window Text** Walk down the tunnel behind Tilly and check if the blockade is as serious as she think it is.\n2\\. Return to Tilly and let her know what you found 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n3\\. Follow Tilly's directions to find the cave 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n4\\. Kill a serpent and collect its venom 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n5\\. Give Tilly the venom so she can check its potency 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n6\\. Find the camp and pour in the poison 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\nLocated at /way +30,-510,-250.\n7\\. Return to Tilly and left her know you are safe 0/1 Dragon Necropolis\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n318 platinum\n17 AA (at level 120)\n**Submitted by:** Gidono, Veludeus",
