ten to me. For starters we have the [lava keepers], there is also the [restless dead] wandering around in the tunnels below. There is another [issue] that will need to be addressed as well, but that one requires a bit more finesse.'\nYou say, ' Tell me about the lava keepers'\nQuincy Algernope says, 'The lava keepers in the crematorium have been getting more and more abundant. Normally this isn't a problem as the crematorium has its own way of regulating the lava keeper population, but something went [wrong].'\nYou say, 'wrong'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Founder's Keepers'.\nQuincy Algernope says, 'I don't know, I can't get close enough to find out why. I'm...' Quincy's eyes begin to glisten as you can see tears welling up again, 'I'm too afraid. But I do know that removing some of the keepers will help the situation. Could you please do that?'\n\n---\n\n**Task Window Text:** The lava keepers have been more active as of late. This has caused the temperature in the crematorium to reach dangerous levels. Take out a few of the keepers in order to help maintain the proper temperature.\n1\\. Lash out at the Lava Keepers 0/8 (Dragon Necropolis)\nYou can find these in the southeast area in the lava tubes.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExperience\nMoney\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
